- 相关性说明：报道在尼斯托尔宫附近发现的“Griffin 
Warrior”墓葬及其中金戒指等金器，是“Ring of Nestor”讨论的核心考古背景之一。  
- 摘录：  
  1. “The grave was found near the Mycenaean Palace of Nestor, at Ano Englianos…
on the floor of the grave lay the skeleton of an adult male… The grave contained
more than 1,400 objects, including gold rings, silver cups, weapons, and 
sealstones.”  
  2. “The discovery was made by a team from the University of Cincinnati in May 
2015 during renewed excavations at the Palace of Nestor in Pylos.”  
  3. “The richly furnished burial has been dubbed the ‘Griffin Warrior’ tomb 
because of an ivory plaque depicting a griffin found among the grave goods.”  

2. 标题：Griffin Warrior Tomb  
