- 相关性说明：对“Griffin Warrior”墓作正式学术发表，提供准确年代（Late Helladic 
IIA）、位置、墓葬结构与随葬品描述，是戒指年代和文化归属的关键依据。  
- 摘录：  
  1. “A large stone‑built shaft tomb of Late Helladic IIA date was discovered 
near Tholos Tomb IV on the first day of renewed excavations at the Palace of 
Nestor.”  
  2. “The tomb contained the articulated skeleton of an adult male accompanied 
by an exceptional assemblage of weapons, sealstones, and gold rings.”  
  3. “The grave’s rich equipment suggests that the deceased was a leading figure
in the early Mycenaean community of Pylos, with strong connections to the Minoan
world as reflected in the iconography of the rings and seals.”  

