- 摘录：  
  1. “The Lord of the Gold Rings: The Griffin Warrior of Pylos explores the 
spectacular discoveries from a single grave—nicknamed the Griffin 
Warrior—excavated near the Palace of Nestor.”  
  2. “Among the most important objects are several gold signet rings whose 
imagery links the early Mycenaean elite to Cretan iconography.”  
  3. “These rings, together with other sealstones, illuminate the role of 
ritual, ideology, and long‑distance connections in the formation of Mycenaean 
culture.”  

