- 摘录：  
  1. “The exhibition ‘Pylos of Nestor: A Mycenaean Kingdom Revealed’ presents 
finds from the palace at Ano Englianos and its surrounding cemeteries.”  
  2. “Multiple tholos tombs have been excavated, along with chamber tombs and 
two shaft graves, one of which is the grave of the ‘Griffin Warrior’.”  
  3. “Precious objects in gold, silver, and semi‑precious stones illustrate the 
