        "墓主年龄：about 30–35 years old",
        "随葬品数量：hundreds",
        "材质：gold, silver, bronze, semiprecious stones"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e7",
      "text": "“Among the most spectacular finds are several gold rings and 
finely engraved sealstones that show scenes of combat and ritual.”",
      "document_ref": "d2",
      "source_ref": "s2",
      "evidence_type": "definition",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "对象：several gold rings, finely engraved sealstones",
        "图像主题：scenes of combat and ritual"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e8",
      "text": "“The Lord of the Gold Rings: The Griffin Warrior of Pylos 
explores the spectacular discoveries from a single grave—nicknamed the Griffin 
Warrior—excavated near the Palace of Nestor.”",
      "document_ref": "d3",
      "source_ref": "s3",
      "evidence_type": "quote",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "讲座焦点：single grave nicknamed the Griffin Warrior",
        "地点：near the Palace of Nestor"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "medium"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e9",
      "text": "“Among the most important objects are several gold signet rings 
whose imagery links the early Mycenaean elite to Cretan iconography.”",
      "document_ref": "d3",
      "source_ref": "s3",
      "evidence_type": "definition",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "对象类型：gold signet rings",
        "图像关联：links early Mycenaean elite to Cretan iconography"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e10",
      "text": "“These rings, together with other sealstones, illuminate the role
of ritual, ideology, and long‑distance connections in the formation of Mycenaean
culture.”",
      "document_ref": "d3",
      "source_ref": "s3",
      "evidence_type": "quote",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "解释主题：ritual, ideology, long-distance connections",
        "文化背景：formation of Mycenaean culture"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e11",
      "text": "“The exhibition ‘Pylos of Nestor: A Mycenaean Kingdom Revealed’ 
presents finds from the palace at Ano Englianos and its surrounding 
cemeteries.”",
      "document_ref": "d4",
      "source_ref": "s4",
      "evidence_type": "definition",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "展览对象：finds from the palace at Ano Englianos and its surrounding 
cemeteries"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e12",
      "text": "“Multiple tholos tombs have been excavated, along with chamber 
tombs and two shaft graves, one of which is the grave of the ‘Griffin 
Warrior’.”",
      "document_ref": "d4",
      "source_ref": "s4",
      "evidence_type": "data",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "墓葬类型与数量：Multiple tholos tombs, chamber tombs, two shaft 
graves",
        "说明：one shaft grave is the grave of the ‘Griffin Warrior’"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e13",
      "text": "“Precious objects in gold, silver, and semi‑precious stones 
illustrate the wealth and ideological world of the early Mycenaean elite at 
Pylos.”",
      "document_ref": "d4",
      "source_ref": "s4",
      "evidence_type": "quote",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "材质：gold, silver, semi-precious stones",
        "功能：illustrate wealth and ideological world"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e14",
      "text": "“A large stone‑built shaft tomb of Late Helladic IIA date was 
discovered near Tholos Tomb IV on the first day of renewed excavations at the 
Palace of Nestor.”",
      "document_ref": "d5",
      "source_ref": "s5",
      "evidence_type": "data",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "墓葬类型：large stone-built shaft tomb",
        "年代：Late Helladic IIA",
        "位置：near Tholos Tomb IV",
        "发现时间点：on the first day of renewed excavations"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e15",
      "text": "“The tomb contained the articulated skeleton of an adult male 
accompanied by an exceptional assemblage of weapons, sealstones, and gold 
rings.”",
      "document_ref": "d5",
      "source_ref": "s5",
      "evidence_type": "data",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "墓主：articulated skeleton of an adult male",
        "随葬品：weapons, sealstones, gold rings",
        "评价：exceptional assemblage"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e16",
      "text": "“The grave’s rich equipment suggests that the deceased was a 
leading figure in the early Mycenaean community of Pylos, with strong 
connections to the Minoan world as reflected in the iconography of the rings and
seals.”",
      "document_ref": "d5",
      "source_ref": "s5",
      "evidence_type": "quote",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "社会地位推断：leading figure in the early Mycenaean community of 
Pylos",
        "文化联系：strong connections to the Minoan world",
        "依据：iconography of the rings and seals"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e17",
      "text": "“In 2015, an astonishing intact warrior grave was discovered just
outside the Palace of Nestor at Pylos, quickly dubbed the ‘Griffin Warrior’ 
tomb.”",
      "document_ref": "d6",
      "source_ref": "s6",
      "evidence_type": "data",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "时间：2015",
        "位置：just outside the Palace of Nestor at Pylos",
        "墓葬性质：intact warrior grave",
        "称呼：quickly dubbed the ‘Griffin Warrior’ tomb"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e18",
      "text": "“The burial, dated to around 1500 BC, contained an array of 
weapons, jewellery and sealstones, including several remarkable gold rings in a 
style closely linked to Minoan Crete.”",
      "document_ref": "d6",
      "source_ref": "s6",
      "evidence_type": "data",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "年代：around 1500 BC",
        "随葬品：weapons, jewellery, sealstones",
        "戒指特点：several remarkable gold rings in a style closely linked to 
Minoan Crete"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "local_ref": "e19",
      "text": "“The finds underline the wealth and far‑reaching connections of 
the local elite in the generations before the great Mycenaean palaces.”",
      "document_ref": "d6",
      "source_ref": "s6",
      "evidence_type": "quote",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": [
        "主题：wealth and far-reaching connections",
        "时间背景：generations before the great Mycenaean palaces"
      ],
      "limitations": [],
      "confidence": "medium"
    }
  ],
  "conflicts": []
}
