- 摘录/摘要：  
  1. 书名说明对象：“‘The ring of Nestor’. A glimpse into the Minoan after‑world 
and a sepulchral treasure of gold signet‑rings and bead‑seals from Thisbê, 
Boeotia.” Evans将“Ring of Nestor”视为该墓葬黄金印章戒指宝藏中的代表性器物。  
  2. 
